WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.004
Product briefing: maintenance and reliever therapy.

2
00:00:04.454 --> 00:00:07.624
Briefing on single-inhaler maintenance and reliever regimens.

3
00:00:08.074 --> 00:00:12.439
A written action plan helps patients recognise and respond to worsening control.

4
00:00:12.889 --> 00:00:17.800
Refer patients with frequent exacerbations despite good adherence for specialist assessment.

5
